-- Give every seeded food_catalog row its default units (issue #727).
-- Generated by `python -m bubbly_chef.domain.catalog_seed --valid-units` from
-- ai-service/bubbly_chef/domain/catalog_units.py. 00016 seeded valid_units as
-- the empty default, so picking an autocomplete suggestion never autofilled
-- the unit. The first unit in each list is the autofill default.
-- A data rewrite of the shared catalog: keyed by canonical (the primary key),
-- touches only valid_units, idempotent (re-running sets the same values).
